+
+-   Required: No
+-   Default: "OK"
+
+The optional custom text to display as the confirmation button's label
+
+### `cancelButtonText`: `string`
+
+-   Required: No
+-   Default: "Cancel"
+
+The optional custom text to display as the cancelation button's label
